    {
      "source": "Create a new <code>AnnotationTypeFilter</code> for the given annotation type.",
      "translation": "为给定的注解类型创建一个新的<code>AnnotationTypeFilter</code>。",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "The filter will not match interfaces.",
      "translation": "该过滤器将不匹配接口。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>annotationType</code> - the annotation type to match",
      "translation": "<code>annotationType</code> - 要匹配的注解类型",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>considerMetaAnnotations</code> - whether to also match on meta-annotations",
      "translation": "<code>considerMetaAnnotations</code> - 是否也要匹配元注解",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "By default, the matching logic mirrors that of\n<a href=\"../../annotation/AnnotationUtils.html#getAnnotation(java.lang.reflect.AnnotatedElement,java.lang.Class)\"><code>AnnotationUtils.getAnnotation(java.lang.reflect.AnnotatedElement, Class)</code></a>,\nsupporting annotations that are <em>present</em> or <em>meta-present</em> for a\nsingle level of meta-annotations. The search for meta-annotations may be disabled.\nSimilarly, the search for annotations on interfaces may optionally be enabled.\nConsult the various constructors in this class for details.",
      "translation": "默认情况下，匹配逻辑与<a href=\"../../annotation/AnnotationUtils.html#getAnnotation(java.lang.reflect.AnnotatedElement,java.lang.Class)\"><code>AnnotationUtils.getAnnotation(java.lang.reflect.AnnotatedElement, Class)</code></a>相同，支持单个级别的元注解的<em>存在</em>或<em>元存在</em>注解。可以禁用对元注解的搜索。同样，可以选择启用对接口上注解的搜索。有关详细信息，请查阅此类的各种构造函数。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The filter will also match meta-annotations. To disable the\nmeta-annotation matching, use the constructor that accepts a\n'<code>considerMetaAnnotations</code>' argument.",
      "translation": "过滤器还将匹配元注解。若要禁用元注解匹配，请使用接受 `<code>considerMetaAnnotations</code>` 参数的构造函数。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
