      "source": "Return the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/annotation/Annotation.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.annotation\"><code>Annotation</code></a> that this instance is using to filter\ncandidates.",
